 "probe_design": {
  "note": "Probes are real indexed passages, leave-one-out: a probe never retrieves itself. Without that exclusion every ranking starts with a free self-match, identical in both regimes, which inflates recall and hides the degradation under test.",
  "exact_topk_from_the_probe_own_item": 0.521,
  "note_on_that": "Chunk overlap is 150 characters, so a passage neighbours its own siblings. Reported rather than filtered: it is the corpus, but it makes retrieval easier than a real query's, so the recall figures should be read next to it."
